|....|
|....|
|..@.|
|.@..|
------

Step away, and wait for him to move to the x.
-+----
|....|
|..@.|
|x._.|
|.@..|
------

Step back on the altar; if the priest moves too, you'll need to start
over. Otherwise, it's boulder time.
-+----
|....|
|.```|
|@`@`|
|.```|
------

